    /// (Settled corrections-B5 D12 item 8, applies to TaskDetail too), and leaving Cancelled or Rejected
    /// for any other state likewise clears <see cref="TaskPatch.Reason"/> (Settled J55: a product bug -
    /// a leftover Reason otherwise gets Save refused outright, since Reason is only valid alongside
    /// Cancelled or Rejected, Spec §9.2).
